  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">District Capitals Water Supply Project (formerly Oecussi and Ermera Water Rehabilitation Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Timor-Leste: Oecussi and Ermera Water Rehabilitation Project will help Ermera, Oecussi, and another district manage their water resources better.  The Project will reduce water-related diseases and raise household incomes, particularly for women.</narrative>
  </description>
